{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>To work it.</b> To serve the soul of life, as it says: וַיִּפַּח בְּאַפָּיו נִשְׁמַת חַיִּים (Genesis 2:7)." "<b>And to keep it.</b> Lest it deteriorate through the consumption of the radical moistures given off by natural heat — for those heavy fruits were constantly producing replacements for what was given off, without decay."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:28:41.448710341Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}